  "details": "Subject: Issues with VRChat Web Home and In-Game Display\n\nHello VRChat Team,\n\nI would like to report several issues I have been experiencing:\n\nMost of the avatars I see are error avatars or impostor avatars (around 90%).\n\nWhen trying to move to another world, I am frequently redirected back to Home.\n\nThumbnails for worlds and friends do not display.\n\nThank you for looking into these issues.\n\nBest regards,",
